  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kabunduli Beekeepers Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kabunduli&apos;s honey project will benefit 61 beekeepers (half women). Funds will be used to provide training for management; staff and members in goodgovernance; participatory assessment; financial management; production quality and safety; best apiculture practices; and will bring processing and factory up to Malawi Bureau of Standards certification.</narrative>
  </description>
